# URL Downloader.app

- The app is a launcher for the web page; it runs the server from this project folder.
- Build it only with `bash create-app.sh`. That installs `/Applications/URL Downloader.app` and moves every other copy to the Trash (the old in-repo build, other clones such as `WebstormProjects/dl-url`, anything Spotlight finds with bundle id `com.local.url-downloader`).
- Never leave a copy anywhere but `/Applications`, and never commit the bundle (it is gitignored).
- Rerun `create-app.sh` after changing `create-app.sh` itself or moving the project folder. Page and server changes need no rebuild.
